    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "1e12e274-28f3-57d4-98ac-57082f2958be",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $AB=BA={I}_{3}$\n- **II.** $AC=CA={I}_{3}$\n- **III.** $B={A}^{-1}$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{3}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{3}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{3}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true. \nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "e3f9df9d-430e-5992-962d-c10ddcb5a0c4",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
